<PageTitle>SMS Terms - ClearlySaid</PageTitle>

<main class="cs-legal">
    <h1>ClearlySaid SMS Terms</h1>
    <p>When you opt in, ClearlySaid may send recurring automated text messages about your account, security, subscription, and requested service activity. This consent does not include marketing messages.</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Message frequency varies.</li>
        <li>Message and data rates may apply.</li>
        <li>Reply STOP to opt out or HELP for help.</li>
        <li>Consent is not a condition of purchase.</li>
        <li>Changing your mobile number requires verification and consent for the new number.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages. You may also withdraw consent from your ClearlySaid profile.</p>
    <p>Questions may be sent to <a href="mailto:support@clearlysaid.ai">support@clearlysaid.ai</a>. Review the <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
</main>
